OL,3,GNEWSAMinor injury unit stays shut in
OL,4,Arecruitment quest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minor injury unit in Cornwall is
OL,7,Fremaining closed because of "workplace
OL,8,Fpressures" NHS bosses have said.
OL,10,FThe unit in Newquay was initially
OL,11,Fclosed in August because the Cornwall
OL,12,FPartnership NHS Foundation Trust said
OL,13,Fit did not have enough specialist
OL,14,Fclinicians to run "a safe, reliable
OL,15,Fservice".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
