OL,3,GNEWSAMinor injury unit stays shut in
OL,4,Arecruitment quest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said it took the "difficult
OL,7,Fdecision" to extend the temporary
OL,8,Fclosure as it was "not yet in a
OL,9,Fposition to consistently provide the
OL,10,Fsafe and reliable service that local
OL,11,Fpeople need and deserve" despite
OL,12,Fprogress in recruiting staff.
OL,14,FA spokesperson explained that Cornwall
OL,15,Ffaced challenges in attracting and
OL,16,Fkeeping healthcare staff "like many
OL,17,Frural and coastal areas".
